 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "What it means",
   "col": "L",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "$|x|$ is the distance of $x$ from $0$. A distance is never negative, so $|x|\\ge 0$."
    },
    {
     "type": "fig",
     "ref": "zero",
     "caption": "$3$ and $-3$ are both $3$ steps from $0$: $\\;|3|=|-3|=3$"
    },
    {
     "type": "ex",
     "lines": [
      "$|3|=3 \\qquad |-10|=10 \\qquad |0|=0$"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "**A letter hides its sign.** If $x=-7$, then $|x|=7=-x$. So for a negative $x$, $|x|=-x$, and $-x$ is positive."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "**An expression inside?** Work out the whole inside first, then the bars: $|4-9|=|-5|=5$."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The rules",
   "col": "R",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "rules",
     "head": [
      "Rule",
      "Example"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "$|a\\cdot b|=|a|\\cdot|b|$ <br>$\\left|\\frac{a}{b}\\right|=\\frac{|a|}{|b|}$",
       "$|-4\\cdot 3|=12=|-4|\\cdot|3|$ <br>Bars can go on each part."
      ],
      [
       "$|a+b|\\le|a|+|b|$",
       "Same signs, the sizes add: $|3+5|=8$ <br>Opposite signs, they cancel: $|3+(-5)|=2<8$"
      ],
      [
       "",
       "Backwards: if the sum came out **smaller**, the signs were **opposite**."
      ],
      [
       "$|x|^2=x^2$ <br>$\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|$",
       "$x=-7$: $\\;\\sqrt{(-7)^2}=\\sqrt{49}=7$ <br>That is $|x|$, not $x$."
      ],
      [
       "$|a-b|=|b-a|$",
       "$|2-9|=|9-2|=7$"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h",
     "text": "Sign clues"
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "class": "clues",
     "head": [
      "If",
      "then",
      "e.g."
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "$|x|>x$",
       "$x<0$",
       "$x=-2\\mathpunct{:}\\;2>-2$"
      ],
      [
       "$|x|=x$",
       "$x\\ge 0$ (zero too)",
       "$x=0$ works"
      ],
      [
       "$|x|=-x$",
       "$x\\le 0$ (zero too)",
       "$x=-7\\mathpunct{:}\\;7=7$"
      ],
      [
       "$x>|x|$",
       "impossible",
       ""
      ],
      [
       "$a\\cdot b>0$",
       "same signs",
       ""
      ],
      [
       "$a\\cdot b<0$",
       "opposite signs",
       ""
      ],
      [
       "$\\frac{x}{|x|}$",
       "$1$ or $-1$",
       "$\\frac{-5}{|-5|}=-1$"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Equations",
   "col": "L",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "ex",
     "label": "Bars = a number: two cases",
     "lines": [
      "$|x+2|=10$",
      "$x+2=10 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=8$",
      "$x+2=-10 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=-12$",
      "Keep both: $x=8$ or $x=-12$"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "ex",
     "label": "A letter on the right: check every answer",
     "lines": [
      "$|x-6|=2x$ (the right side must be $\\ge 0$)",
      "$x-6=2x \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=-6$ ✗ $\\;(2x=-12<0)$",
      "$x-6=-2x \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=2$ ✓ $\\;(|-4|=4)$"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "ex",
     "label": "Bars on both sides: square both sides",
     "lines": [
      "$|x-1|=|x+3|$",
      "$x^2-2x+1=x^2+6x+9$",
      "$-8x=8 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=-1$"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Distance between two numbers",
   "col": "R",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "$|x-a|$ is the distance between $x$ and $a$. **A plus inside** means a negative point: $|x+6|=|x-(-6)|$, the distance from $-6$."
    },
    {
     "type": "fig",
     "ref": "from6",
     "caption": "$|x+6|=3$: $\\;3$ steps from $-6$, so $x=-3$ or $x=-9$"
